  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazil - Improving Public Procurement Systems for Enhanced Governance and Transparency in Minas Gerais - Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project&apos;s development objective is to enhance the efficiency and quality of public sppending in the state of Minas Gerais, Brazil, through the improvement of governance and transparency of the procurement systems. 1/11/07 - TM&apos;s name changed from Enzo de Laurentiis to Alexandre Borges de Oliveira per Ms. Diana Corbin&apos;s request. Improve transparency and management information tools for civil works contracts and payments of the government procurement system of the State of Minas Gerais.</narrative>
  </description>
